            text: "One year. LifeSmart’s warranty page states a 1-year limited warranty on all products, covering functional parts for personal use, with claims made through the retailer where you bought it. Extended plans were offered at checkout from $49.99 to $99.99.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Who makes LifeSmart treadmills?",
