              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TM4000</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">LifeSmart, Dick's</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$1,199, out of stock</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">20 x 60 in., 14 mph</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TM4000C</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">LifeSmart</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$1,199, in stock</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">20 x 60 in., 14 mph</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TM4500</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Formerly Costco, LifeSmart</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Discontinued</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">20 x 60 in., 14 mph</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TM4800</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Costco warehouses</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Unclear (see below)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">20 x 60 in.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TM5000</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">LifeSmart</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$1,699, in stock</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">20 x 60 in., 14 mph</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TM6500</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Costco online</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Listed; price not shown to us</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">20 x 60 in., 14 mph</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">TM55</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Costco online</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Listed; price not shown to us</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">20 x 55 in., 10 mph</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
          <p>
            Below these, LifeSmart also sells cheaper budget machines: the TM2301 Lift Assist
            at $299, the TM2305 2-in-1 at $399, and the TM2202 3-in-1 and TM2303 PowerTouch at $599 each. The "C"
            suffix marks an updated version — LifeSmart says the TM4000C adds a reinforced frame for incline stability, a
            wireless charging console and 26 programs to the TM4000 — so check which one a retailer is selling.
          </p>
        </div>
